          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Paul Schoenfeld"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I finally got my longstanding issues resolved.  I should have consulted Alan a long time ago considering all the time I spent trying to fix things myself.  I had thousands of missing photographs in the Lightroom Classic catalog.  This is fixed now.  Also enjoyed working with Alan.  We got on fine.  Excellent experience entirely.  Would recommend Alan to a friend and consult with him again.",
