            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Emoke Ispan"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I have attended 2 photography courses (beginners & Lightroom) and 2 workshops (garden & woodland) with Alan so far and I really enjoyed all of them! He's a great teacher, who does not just simply shares his vast knowledge of photography, but also inspires you to want to learn all the (sometimes quite dry) technical details, so you can create amazing images that you can be proud of. I'm very happy for finding Alan right at the beginning of my photography journey and looking forward to attending more of his workshops in the future.",
